astratta

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:04.420
in un comportamento

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:04.840
tangibile

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:05.460
del flusso di lavoro

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.260
la tua IA

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.060
non si fida semplicemente

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:07.620
del testo

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.700
lo esamina criticamente

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.020
il tuo flusso

